{
  "title": "BUILD - Foundry",
  "locked": false,
  "description": "Enterprise build path from local agent to Foundry-hosted, grounded agent published across Microsoft 365.",
  "rows": [
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "I’m back in the office, and the rubber duck review has finished.\n\nNow let’s take that same agent and make it production ready.\n\nI don't have to rebuild anything. I'm still working with the same agent. I'm just giving it access to the services it needs.",
      "demo_actions": "Stay in the same session with the Part 1 canvas still visible. Frame this as the move from local proof of concept to production readiness.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Right from GitHub Copilot, I connect to Microsoft Foundry.\n\nThe setup stays the same.\n\nI'm just moving it to a hosted environment and connecting it to our contract data.",
      "demo_actions": "Type 'Let's move it into Microsoft Foundry and ground it on our real contracts.' Show the Foundry Agent canvas opening with the selected model.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~15s",
      "narrative": "Let’s look at the Anatomy of an Agent again.\n\nModel.\n\nInstructions.\n\nContext.\n\nThose are the same pieces we used on the plane.\n\nThe new part is Tools.\n\nI’ve connected FoundryIQ to our approved contracts, so the agent can pull in the real terms instead of relying only on the prompt.\n\nMemory shows up as soon as I start the conversation.",
      "demo_actions": "Point at the Tools tile and call out Foundry IQ with the contracts knowledge base.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "Now, if we look at the code we added to wire this up to Foundry - and don’t worry if you don’t read Python - there are really only 3 things happening:\n\nFirst, we’re switching to a production model, GPT-5.5, running in Microsoft Foundry with enterprise authentication and governance.\n\nNext, we’re connecting Foundry IQ so the agent can ground every answer in our approved contracts.\n\nFinally, we assemble the agent using the same instructions from our local agent, plus our Foundry model and the FoundryIQ tool.\n\nThat’s the path from proof of concept to production ready.",
      "demo_actions": "Click the Connection tab and show build_agent(), the model choice, the Foundry endpoint, and FoundryIQ(knowledge_base='contracts-kb').",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~10s",
      "narrative": "Now let's ask the same question again.\n\nSame invoice.\n\nSame prompt.\n\nYou’ll notice this one takes a little longer.\n\nMy laptop agent only had the invoice. This one reaches into FoundryIQ, pulls the actual contract language, and checks every invoice line against what we agreed to.",
      "demo_actions": "Click the Chat tab, attach invoice-asterridge.pdf, and ask the contract audit question.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "duration_seconds": 30,
      "narrative": "It’s not guessing. It’s grounding every answer in our contract data.\n\nThis time it finds what my laptop couldn’t: a unit price that’s higher than our negotiated rate.\n\nAnd a $99,880 packaging charge that was never authorized. Both are backed by the contract clauses they came from.",
      "demo_actions": "",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~35s",
      "narrative": "And that’s what makes this auditable. The Trace view shows the retrieval in real time.\n\nThe question sent to FoundryIQ.\n\nThe contract passages it retrieved.\n\nAnd the exact clauses behind each conclusion.\n\nThat’s the difference between an answer and an answer you can defend.",
      "demo_actions": "After the answer returns, click the Trace tab and show the live knowledge_base_retrieve call with the highlighted contract clauses behind each finding.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~15s",
      "narrative": "Once I'm happy with the results, publishing is one step. Now the hosted agent is ready for real business workflows. I’ve also made it available where my finance team already works: Microsoft Teams.\n\nSame agent.\n\nSame grounding.\n\nSame traceability.\n\nIt just shows up where they already collaborate.",
      "demo_actions": "Narrate the publish beat and show the Foundry canvas in its ready-to-publish state.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "duration_seconds": 30,
      "narrative": "From Teams, I can open the invoice details directly. That deep link takes me to the full record, where I can see the decision, the evidence behind it, and the source documents the agent used. And if I jump into the agent run, the broader system comes into view. We have several specialist agents working together, each connected to the right IQs to review the case and move it forward.",
      "demo_actions": "",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
        "time": false,
        "narrative": false,
        "demo_actions": false,
