        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "What started as a proof of concept on a plane is now a governed, grounded, production ready agent. Built in the GitHub Copilot app. Hosted in Microsoft Foundry. Available where the business already works.",
      "demo_actions": "Transition to the Waypoint app visual and orient the viewer to the invoice review UI.",
